/* Experiment 179 -- SIAM 100-Digit Challenge, Appendix D Problem 4 (Maxima column).
   Maxima has moebius and expintegral_li but no numerical infinite-series
   summation (sum/nusum are symbolic) and no Riemann R, so every row is a SKIP.
   See riemann_r_zero.m. */
load("../harness.mac")$
load("../siam100_common.mac")$
skip("d4.machine", "nsum")$
skip("d4.wp50", "nsum")$
skip("d4.wp50-builtin", "RiemannR")$
quit()$
